---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="AI/ML Deep Dives">
<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 6.5rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .625rem;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--purple-l);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 18px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--purple);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--text) 40%, var(--muted2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.075rem;
    color: var(--muted2);
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .posts-section {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem 7rem;
  }
  .section-rule {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .875rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .section-rule h2 {
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  }
  .section-rule::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .post-card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .post-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-dim) 0%, transparent 55%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity .3s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .post-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(139,92,246,.5);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(139,92,246,.1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .post-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .post-featured-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .3rem;
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--amber);
    background: rgba(245,158,11,.09);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.22);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: .18rem .55rem;
    margin-bottom: .875rem;
    font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  }
  .post-card .tags { margin-bottom: .875rem; }
  .post-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: .5rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .post-card p {
    font-size: .875rem;
    color: var(--muted2);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .post-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    font-size: .775rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .post-arrow {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--purple-l);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: transform .2s;
  }
  .post-card:hover .post-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: .775rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">Personal Research Blog</div>
  <h1>Exploring the frontier<br>of AI &amp; ML</h1>
  <p>Deep dives into research papers, model architectures, and open-source implementations — with interactive visualizations and annotated source code.</p>
</section>

<section class="posts-section">
  <div class="section-rule"><h2>Latest Posts</h2></div>

  <a class="post-card" href="/posts/gemma4-mtp/">
    <div class="post-featured-badge">★ Latest</div>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag tag-purple">Gemma 4</span>
      <span class="tag tag-cyan">Multi-Token Prediction</span>
      <span class="tag tag-cyan">Speculative Decoding</span>
      <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
    </div>
    <h3>How Gemma 4's Multi-Token Prediction Works</h3>
    <p>A deep dive into the Gemma4 Assistant architecture: KV sharing between the backbone and draft model, centroid-based vocabulary prediction, and bidirectional attention masks — with animated visualizations and annotated source code.</p>
    <div class="post-meta">
      <span>May 24, 2026</span>
      <span>~15 min read</span>
      <span class="post-arrow">→</span>
    </div>
  </a>
</section>

<footer>Built with curiosity. Source on GitHub.</footer>
</BaseLayout>
